 "description": "A lovely two double bedroom mid-terrace property situated on this popular street with great access to nearby Chapel Allerton, Roundhay, & Oakwood. Neutrally decorated throughout - the property has great curb appeal and has an entrance porch, large lounge diner with contemporary electric flame effect fire, fully fitted kitchen at the rear with appliances including a fridge freezer, slimline dishwasher & washing machine & door leading to the rear garden. \n\nUpstairs - there is a generous main bedroom, well proportioned second double bedroom and a beautiful house bathroom which has been recently installed with contemporary tiling, Rain shower over the bath & matt black towel heater. \n\nExternally - the rear garden is tiered & private with fence borders. There is a parking space to the front of the property and there is the additional benefit of a single garage. \n\nAvailable Immediately. Unfurnished with kitchen appliances. Bond - Equivalent to 5 weeks rent.",
